sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Usuario
    participant APP as App C# Desktop
    participant API as RehabEasy Transfer API
    participant DB as SQLite local

    U->>APP: Cola payload_id e clica em Importar payload
    APP->>API: GET /api/payloads/{id}
    API->>APP: Retorna payload e marca como consumido
    APP->>APP: Normaliza registros
    APP->>DB: Salva registros locais
    APP->>U: Exibe lista importada
